'''Master of Life Dr. Nova''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]] and unlocked after clearing the [[Revival of Origin/Invasion|Revival of Origin Invasion]] which appears after beating all [[Uncanny Legends]] sub-chapters on {{4c}} difficulty.

