|name2 = Master of Life Catnova
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Master of Life Catnova''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Nova is often compared to [[Miko Mitama (Uber Rare Cat)|Mitama the Oracle]], a durable support unit reliant on status effects to impede foes. Nova carries significantly more health, matching Mitama's own in spite of the latter's Resistance ability, but otherwise has similar damage and identical range/Slow duration. Nova does have lower uptime, but compensates through the addition of various other attributes.

The first of these is Immunity to Curse, which prevents her abilities from being disabled, unlike Mitama who would crumble very quickly when it occurs. Her second advantage is her Curse ability, which, while inconsistent, can occasionally answer various enemy abilities, assuming they are vulnerable to Curse, as in the case with [[Winged Pigge]] or [[:Category:Enemies with Toxic ability|Toxic enemies]]. Additionally, her [[Sage Slayer]] ability not only improves her effective stats against [[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage enemies]], but also allows her to dismiss their resistance to her CC alongside withstanding their status effects better. However, do note that she is not immune to anything besides Curse, so timing may be needed for certain enemies. The last ability to touch on is her [[Explosion]], which not only help to increase her subpar damage but also extend her reach for her abilities, as it reaches from 75 to 625 range, allows her to hit any backliners she may have missed or slow down/push back anything that entered her blind spot. Additionally, Nova's extremely high HP stat allows her to tank a few hits without flinching, which is especially useful in stages containing lots of [[:Category:Long Distance Enemies|enemies with Long Distance]] or other forms of piercing damage, despite her slow speed.

Overall, a very good unit and well worth beating all of {{4c}} Uncanny Legends.

